<p>Note - Q4 1996 results include charges of $5.1 million related to write-downs associated with the company's new focus on branded systems and software sales, product transitions and a discontinuation of certain OEM hardware royalty agreements. In addition, the company took charges of $1.9 million for price protection. Without the adjustments, net revenues for the fourth quarter would have been $17.9 million and the net loss would have been $6.0 million.</p>
